  <steps mode="directional">
    <step order="0" name="Rigor + load">Emit RIGOR LEVEL (FULL). Read docs/architecture/SPAARKE-FIELD-MAPPING-FRAMEWORK.md IN FULL for the field-mapping schema; identify the chart-def table's schema from the Dataverse data-model docs or a live schema query.</step>
