  <notes>Justification (CLAUDE.md §11): Existing -- NOTHING exists for these 2 scopes anywhere in the repo (not even a script) -- this is genuinely greenfield, confirmed by DS-4's audit. Extension -- N/A for the content; the EXECUTION PATTERN extends the already-proven Dataverse Web API seeder idiom from task 150/151, avoiding a third parallel pattern. Cost-of-doing-nothing -- FR-16 stays permanently half-delivered; every new customer provisioned would have zero field-mapping and zero chart-definition seed data, silently, since H12b currently reports Success for these scopes despite doing nothing (DeferredAppConfigSeeder's no-op).</notes>

